<%- include('partials/head') %>

<div class="how">
  <h1>How it works.</h1>
  <p>Every week someone on the internet says "those two should debate." Throwdown is where that sentence turns into a number, and the number turns into a debate.</p>

  <h2>1. Someone proposes a matchup</h2>
  <p>Two names, one question, a target. Proposing requires a pledge, so every matchup on the site has at least one person with real money behind it. If it funds, the proposer earns <%= SPLIT.proposer %>% of the pot for having the idea and pushing it.</p>

  <h2>2. People pledge</h2>
  <p>Anyone can back a matchup. You enter an amount and save a card. <strong>Nothing is charged.</strong> The total climbs publicly, and the page is built to be shared — that's how the number grows.</p>

  <h2>3. It funds</h2>
  <p>When the total hits the target, we invite both debaters. Each is offered <%= SPLIT.debater %>% of the pot — an appearance fee, not a prize, so nobody has to win to get paid. Both have to say yes.</p>

  <h2>4. Cards are charged — only now</h2>
  <p>Once both debaters accept, every backer's card is charged for exactly what they pledged. If either debater declines, or the matchup doesn't reach its target within <%= DEADLINE_DAYS %> days, nothing is charged and the matchup closes. No refunds, because there was never a charge.</p>

  <h2>5. The debate happens</h2>
  <p>It's recorded, posted on the matchup page, and every backer gets a link. The crowd decides who won in the replies.</p>

  <h2>The split</h2>
  <ol>
    <li><strong><%= SPLIT.debater %>%</strong> to each debater</li>
    <li><strong><%= SPLIT.proposer %>%</strong> to the person who proposed it</li>
    <li><strong><%= SPLIT.platform %>%</strong> to Throwdown</li>
  </ol>

  <p>Debaters and the proposer are paid from what's actually collected when cards are charged, which can be a little less than the pledged total if some cards fail. Details in the <a href="/terms" style="color:var(--text)">terms</a>.</p>

  <p style="margin-top:40px"><a class="btn btn-primary" href="/new">Propose a debate</a></p>
</div>

